Pako Engineers - Gear Manufacturing Capabilities

Custom gears and gear shafts manufactured for rotating assemblies and heavy engineering equipment.

Typical capability:
- Gear types: spur and helical gears
- Materials: EN353, 8620, EN8, EN9, carbon steel, alloy steel, and bronze
- Processes: blank turning, hobbing, heat treatment, bore grinding, face grinding, and profile grinding where specified
- Heat treatment: carburizing, induction hardening, and nitriding
- Inspection: pitch, profile, hardness, concentricity, and dimensional checks

Final capacity and quality grade are confirmed after drawing review.
